\" data-flag=\"normal\">还好，本周即将入伏，热爆表就变得……更加顺理成章。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">14日至17日，华南地区也将有阶段性高温天气，空气湿度大，湿热特征明显。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"3\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/441c-audiofreehighqps/E2/D3/GAqhVp8MSkRFAAEJBAPhxqTi.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/441c-audiofreehighqps/E2/D3/GAqhVp8MSkRFAAEJBAPhxqTi.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/441c-audiofreehighqps/E2/D3/GAqhVp8MSkRFAAEJBAPhxqTi.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"625\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/441c-audiofreehighqps/E2/D3/GAqhVp8MSkRFAAEJBAPhxqTi.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"116\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">夏季的海面依然热闹，昨日，今年第5号台风“百合”生成，并向日本东部沿海靠近，未来对我国并无无影响。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">但别掉以轻心，未来10日西北太平洋还将有1至2个台风生成，并可能于中旬后期影响我国东南部海域。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"4\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/f028-audiofreehighqps/2B/B9/GAqhfD0MSkRGAAD28APhxqU-.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/f028-audiofreehighqps/2B/B9/GAqhfD0MSkRGAAD28APhxqU-.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/f028-audiofreehighqps/2B/B9/GAqhfD0MSkRGAAD28APhxqU-.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"657\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/f028-audiofreehighqps/2B/B9/GAqhfD0MSkRGAAD28APhxqU-.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"122\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">本周天气舞台上，除了炎热，台风，还有各种强降水。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">中央气象台预计，未来三天，华北、东北地区、黄淮等地多雷阵雨，局地有大到暴雨，并伴有雷暴大风或短时强降水等强对流天气；江南、华南、云南等地有分散性强降水，局地有大到暴雨。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"5\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/0823-audiofreehighqps/81/46/GAqhntAMSkRGAACvWgPhxqXB.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/0823-audiofreehighqps/81/46/GAqhntAMSkRGAACvWgPhxqXB.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/0823-audiofreehighqps/81/46/GAqhntAMSkRGAACvWgPhxqXB.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"563\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/0823-audiofreehighqps/81/46/GAqhntAMSkRGAACvWgPhxqXB.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"105\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">最近的广东，被雨淋了一遍又一遍，今日依然多雷雨，局部雨势强烈；明后开始，副高继续西进一步，压制大气中的“捣乱分子”，阵雨减弱，高温返场，炎热伴有午后分散（雷）阵雨。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">具体预报：</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">14日，粤北和肇庆市县多云到阴天，有中（雷）雨，局部暴雨或大暴雨，其余市县多云，有分散（雷）阵雨局部暴雨。最高气温：粤北偏北市县和南部沿海市县29℃～32℃，其余市县33℃～36℃。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">15日，广东省大部市县多云，有分散（雷）阵雨局部暴雨。最高气温：南部沿海市县、河源和梅州市县30℃～33℃，其余市县34℃～37℃。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">16日，广东省大部市县多云间晴天，局部有（雷）阵雨。最高气温：南部沿海市县30℃～33℃，其余市县34℃～37℃。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"6\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/7ae6-audiofreehighqps/CD/17/GAqhp50MSkRGAAC8cwPhxqYX.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/7ae6-audiofreehighqps/CD/17/GAqhp50MSkRGAAC8cwPhxqYX.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/7ae6-audiofreehighqps/CD/17/GAqhp50MSkRGAAC8cwPhxqYX.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"495\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/7ae6-audiofreehighqps/CD/17/GAqhp50MSkRGAAC8cwPhxqYX.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"92\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"7\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/d92e-audiofreehighqps/01/9E/GAqhqKwMSkRHAACMxgPhxqZt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/d92e-audiofreehighqps/01/9E/GAqhqKwMSkRHAACMxgPhxqZt.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/d92e-audiofreehighqps/01/9E/GAqhqKwMSkRHAACMxgPhxqZt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"495\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/d92e-audiofreehighqps/01/9E/GAqhqKwMSkRHAACMxgPhxqZt.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"92\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">广州方面，雷雨还有，但气温继续缓慢上行，高温返场。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">具体预报：</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">14日，多云，有雷阵雨局部大雨，26℃到34℃；</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">15日，多云到晴，局部有雷阵雨，27℃到35℃；</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">16日，多云到晴，局部有雷阵雨，27℃到35℃。</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"8\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/85ed-audiofreehighqps/A7/FE/GAqh1QQMSkRHAAFboAPhxqbF.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/85ed-audiofreehighqps/A7/FE/GAqh1QQMSkRHAAFboAPhxqbF.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/85ed-audiofreehighqps/A7/FE/GAqh1QQMSkRHAAFboAPhxqbF.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-large-height=\"879\" data-preview=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/85ed-audiofreehighqps/A7/FE/GAqh1QQMSkRHAAFboAPhxqbF.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_small\" data-large-width=\"750\" data-preview-height=\"164\"></span></p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\">那些关于高温的不靠谱说法，你知道多少？了解一下吧↓↓↓</p><p style=\"color:#333333;font-weight:normal;font-size:16px;line-height:30px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;hyphens:auto;text-align:justify;\" data-flag=\"normal\"><span><img data-key=\"9\" src=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/aaf0-audiofreehighqps/B3/76/GAqh4zIMSkRHAAGUnQPhxqct.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;name=mobile_large\" data-origin=\"http://fdfs.xmcdn.com/storages/aaf0-audiofreehighqps/B3/76/GAqh4zIMSkRHAAGUnQPhxqct.jpg\" data-preview-width=\"140\" data-large=\"http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/aaf0-audiofreehighqps/B3/76/GAqh4zIMSkRHAAGUnQPhxqct.jpg!op_type=4&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;device_type=ios&amp;